吕二佥宪分巡未还 其一","author":"刘崧","text":"十年不见寿安红，三月燕城雾雨中。\n未省何人旧栽得，斩新雨露斗春风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25377,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"庭下牡丹盛开感赋二首忆徐吕二佥宪分巡未还 其二","author":"刘崧","text":"绀芽翠叶蔼离离，喜见新年发数枝。\n无酒无朋难独赏，每来花畔立多时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25378,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"观城外练兵","author":"刘崧","text":"年少粗豪喜战功，短袍新赐锦重重。\n对箭戳鎗誇得隽，骣骑官马去如龙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25379,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"种柳","author":"刘崧","text":"绕城密密插垂杨，近水仍添四五行。\n莫遣行人来系马，更教遮护起藩墙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25380,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"海子桥晚眺","author":"刘崧","text":"海上青山山上云，空青锦绣自成文。\n广寒西下红桥晚，两岸荷花一径分。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25381,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题黄渊静替礼墨竹纨扇","author":"刘崧","text":"潇洒颂台赞礼郎，手持纨扇白于霜。\n只今写得筼筜竹，清昼无风也自凉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25382,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋日燕城杂赋五首 其一","author":"刘崧","text":"南城土垣故不塌，西宫渠水自相通。\n野